What is a Laser Mode Converter?
Laser Mode Converters are specialized optical devices that transform the spatial or polarization characteristics of laser beams. These components serve as critical intermediaries in photonic systems, enabling efficient conversion between modes such as Gaussian to TEM or LP modes. Through precise manipulation of light fields using high-refractive-index materials and advanced coatings, these devices enhance transmission efficiency while maintaining beam quality across diverse applications.
